# Implementation Plan - Phase 2: Flyer Ingestion & Moderation

# Goal Description
Enable the "Flyer & Deal Integration" whereby stores can upload physical flyer images, and an automated pipeline (with human-in-the-loop) extracts deals. This is a key differentiator for Spendigo.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **OCR Strategy**:
> We will use **Tesseract.js** (client-side/server-side node) for the free tier initially to avoid Cloud Vision costs ($1.50/1k).
> - **Fallback**: If Tesseract fails (confidence < 0.6), flag for manual review.

> [!WARNING]
> **Moderation Queue**:
> Admin users must have a UI to manually draw bounding boxes or correct text. I will build a canvas-based "Annotator" tool in the Admin Panel.

